# Download CC0 PBR texture sets from polyhaven.com
# Required sets (1K resolution):
#   ground_albedo.jpg, ground_normal.jpg, ground_roughness.jpg, ground_ao.jpg
#   rubble_albedo.jpg, rubble_normal.jpg, rubble_roughness.jpg
#
# Recommended: "Aerial Rocks" or "Gravel Stones" for rubble
#              "Mud Cracked" for flood areas
#              "Asphalt" for road patches
